{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be the Block</strong> is a clever, focused puzzle game designed for players who enjoy thoughtful logic puzzles without the crushing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t just push the blocks, you <i>are</i> the blocks. Every level revolves around a unique twist on classic block-pushing puzzles: press an arrow key, and every block that can move in that direction does so at once. With each type of block moving differently, understanding their combined, simultaneous movement is the key to solving each puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/extras/c4b5f6c5d289ba94d52cf06b4bfbb681.poster.avif?t=1760116876\" width=500 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/extras/c4b5f6c5d289ba94d52cf06b4bfbb681.webm?t=1760116876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/extras/c4b5f6c5d289ba94d52cf06b4bfbb681.mp4?t=1760116876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The result is a collection of smart, elegant, and deeply satisfying challenges that look simple but reveal surprising depth. It is never about memorizing complex systems or grinding through frustration; it is about that clean, rewarding aha! moment when your solution clicks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for anyone who enjoys clever puzzles but prefers a gentler difficulty curve.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971050?t=1760116876","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971050?t=1760116876","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/1409bd99276fb2a0bbae767a48a2ca5510c8ca87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760116876","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/1409bd99276fb2a0bbae767a48a2ca5510c8ca87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760116876","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be the Block</strong> is a clever, focused puzzle game designed for players who enjoy thoughtful logic puzzles without the crushing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t just push the blocks, you <i>are</i> the blocks. Every level revolves around a unique twist on classic block-pushing puzzles: press an arrow key, and every block that can move in that direction does so at once. With each type of block moving differently, understanding their combined, simultaneous movement is the key to solving each puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/extras/c4b5f6c5d289ba94d52cf06b4bfbb681.poster.avif?t=1760116876\" width=500 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/extras/c4b5f6c5d289ba94d52cf06b4bfbb681.webm?t=1760116876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971050/extras/c4b5f6c5d289ba94d52cf06b4bfbb681.mp4?t=1760116876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The result is a collection of smart, elegant, and deeply satisfying challenges that look simple but reveal surprising depth. It is never about memorizin